    "html": "<p>When a horizontal spring is stretched, the force exerted by the spring is directly proportional to its extension.</p>\n<p>The energy transferred to a spring to extend it by a distance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"x\"></span> is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"E\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What work is done by the spring when the extension is reduced by <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{x}{3}\"></span> ? <br/><br/></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{2E}{9}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{E}{3}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{4E}{9}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{5E}{9}\"></span></li></ol>"
